  "description": "Native video control for .NET MAUI built for analysis rather than viewing: frame-accurate seeking, frame-by-frame stepping, slow motion from 0.25x, and position events at 10-30 Hz for driving a map or timeline. Plays several files as one timeline (camera chapters), and plays by reference without copying - file paths, iOS photo-library assets and security-scoped bookmarks, Android content URIs. AVFoundation on iOS, Media3 ExoPlayer on Android, no system playback UI.",
